{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"vlang","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"V","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for V (.vsh .vv).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"vlang","name":"V","extensions":[".vsh",".vv"],"grammar":"grammars/vlang.json","filenames":["v.mod"],"lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"V","path":"snippets/vlang.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/vlang.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\[[a-z_]+(?::[^\\\\]]*)?\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:__offsetof|interface|isreftype|continue|volatile|__global|assert|atomic|import|module|return|select|shared|sizeof|static|struct|typeof|unsafe|break|const|defer|match|rlock|union|else|enum|goto|lock|none|asm|for|mut|pub|as|fn|go|if|in|is|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|none)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:voidptr|string|bool|rune|byte|int|i16|i32|i64|u16|u32|u64|f32|f64|any|map|i8|u8)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:eprintln|println|print|panic|exit)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/vlang.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Main\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"fn main() {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The main function\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"fn ${1:name}(${2:arg} ${3:int}) ${4:int} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Struct\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"struct\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"struct ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\t${2:field} ${3:int}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A struct\"\n  },\n  \"Println\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"println(${1:value})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"println\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# V\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for V.\n\n## Files\n\n`.vsh`, `.vv`, `v.mod`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `main` | The main function |\n| `fn` | A function |\n| `struct` | A struct |\n| `pl` | println |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}